{"articleNo":"470927","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=470927&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] 2023학년도 전기(2024년 2월) 졸업예정자 성적취소 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.12.13","hit":"7055","attachments":[{"name":"(붙임2) 성적취소 신청원(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=470927&attachNo=129800"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2023학</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">년도 전기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">년&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업예정자 대상 성적취소 신청을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 희망자는 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">성적취소 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2014</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학년도 이전 이수</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>한 성적에 한하며</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">아래 항목 중 하나에 해당하는 경우 성적취소 가능함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1) 7</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 이상 등록자에 한하여&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학점 이내의 성적</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">교육과정의 개정으로 폐지된 교과목의 성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">제한 없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업예정자로서 성적이&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">“F”</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">인 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">제한 없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2024. 1. 10.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">∼&nbsp;11</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신청장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">소속 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">성적취소 신청원(첨부 파일)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">성적증명서 제출 생략</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">성적취소 신청원 작성 시 교과목코드 및 교과목명 정확히 기재해야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">성적취소 결과 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2024. 1. 18.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">확인방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학적부</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학적자료조회</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">성적정정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">포기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-left: 28.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -28.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2015</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학년도 이후 이수한 교과목에 대해서는 성적취소 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">성적취소 신청은 재학 중&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">회에 한함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">성적취소 이력이 있는 경우 취소 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 41.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 33.6px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -41.2pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">2023. 12.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼둥근헤드라인; font-size: 24pt;\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
